[0.051, "o", "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[1mstandbox\u001b[0m  per-agent client-side permission gates for CLIs\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2mdescribe a sandbox in plain English, get an enforced gate + report\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[2.008, "o", "\u001b[32m$ standbox_generate \"only namespace mfsada, crud on pods and deployments, port-forward allowed, no jobs but cronjobs ok, no secrets\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.981, "o", "wrote bundles/agent/sandbox.md\r\n"]
[2.018, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m--- use cases tested against the gate (real gate runs) ---\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.135, "o", "## Use cases TESTED against the gate (**verified by running the gate**)\r\n| OK | Command | Verdict | Why |\r\n|---|---|---|---|\r\n| ✅ | `patch cronjobs/x -n mfsada -p {}` | **ALLOW** | apply cronjobs |\r\n| ✅ | `get cronjobs -n mfsada` | **ALLOW** | describe cronjobs |\r\n| ✅ | `logs pod/x -n mfsada --tail=10` | **ALLOW** | logs pod |\r\n| ✅ | `port-forward svc/x 8080:80 -n mfsada` | **ALLOW** | port-forward svc |\r\n| ✅ | `patch deployments/x -n mfsada -p {}` | **ALLOW** | apply deployments |\r\n| ✅ | `get deployments -n mfsada` | **ALLOW** | describe deployments |\r\n| ✅ | `patch pods/x -n mfsada -p {}` | **ALLOW** | apply pods |\r\n| ✅ | `get pods -n mfsada` | **ALLOW** | describe pods |\r\n| ✅ | `get jobs -n mfsada` | **BLOCK** | denied jobs |\r\n| ✅ | `get secrets -n mfsada` | **BLOCK** | denied secrets |\r\n| ✅ | `get deployments -n prod` | **BLOCK** | denied wrong ns |\r\n| ✅ | `get --raw /api` | **BLOCK** | denied --raw |\r\n| ✅ | `get pods -A` | **BLOCK** | denied -A |\r\n| ✅ | `port-forward svc/x 8080"]
[0.000, "o", ":80 -n prod` | **BLOCK** | port-forward svc on wrong ns |\r\n\r\n### Run it locally\r\n```\r\nexport PATH=agent/kubectl/gate:$PATH\r\nkubectl get deployments -n mfsada   # ALLOWED\r\nkubectl get secrets -n mfsada       # BLOCKED\r\n```\r\n\r\n### \r\n"]
[3.017, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m--- run the gate directly ---\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[32m$ kubectl get deployments -n mfsada\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.063, "o", "get deployments\r\n"]
[1.514, "o", "\u001b[32m$ kubectl port-forward svc/web 8080:80 -n mfsada\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.848, "o", "port-forward svc/web 8080:80\r\n"]
[1.511, "o", "\u001b[32m$ kubectl get secrets -n mfsada\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.825, "o", "BLOCKED: resource/target 'secrets' not allowed\r\n"]
[1.508, "o", "\u001b[32m$ kubectl get jobs -n mfsada\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.832, "o", "BLOCKED: resource/target 'jobs' not allowed\r\n"]
[1.507, "o", "\u001b[32m$ kubectl get pods -n prod\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.830, "o", "BLOCKED: namespace 'prod' not allowed\r\n"]
[1.513, "o", "\u001b[32m$ kubectl get pods -A\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.834, "o", "BLOCKED: '-A' not allowed\r\n"]
[1.511, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m--- one command to run it in a container ---\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.052, "o", "docker build -q -t agent \"agent/kubectl/container\"\r\ndocker run --rm -it --entrypoint bash \\\r\n  --network none --cap-drop ALL --security-opt no-new-privileges \\\r\n  --read-only --tmpfs /tmp --tmpfs /run agent\r\n"]
[0.007, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m(the gated kubectl is the ONLY kubectl in that image)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.038, "x", "0"]
